.02, "You place four cards under the corners of your mattress,"], [59.34, 61.28, "weave them up to 90 days, then discard."], [61.6, 63.68, "In lab testing, capture cards captured"], [63.68, 66.2, "up to 99% of dust mites."], [66.32, 66.96, "It's not a cure."], [67.24, 68.42, "It's ruling something out."], [68.66, 70.82, "And that felt like the first concrete step"], [70.82, 72.02, "I could actually take."], [72.18, 73.94, "See capture cards at the link below."], [74.24, 76.98, "90-day money-back guarantee, no return required."]]}